 162: ## T14 — Polling fallback during Realtime outages
 163: Reasoning: G3's second half; depends on stream health and has its own merge-safety risk (AC-048).
 164: Task: While any required stream has been unhealthy > 30 s and the tab is visible, the open conversation's new 
messages, its loaded messages' receipt summaries, any open reader-details list, and the conversation list are fetched 
